Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, it's so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.77,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.97,0:01:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want.\NTogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't wanna live ordinary lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.73,0:01:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.75,0:01:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in wonderland.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.29,0:01:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.71,0:01:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.27,0:02:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready? Aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.81,0:02:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.33,0:02:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting is not going to help anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.69,0:02:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.99,0:02:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It only graced my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.37,0:02:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.28,0:02:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't land.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.49,0:02:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But can you please call us a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.29,0:02:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our friend is dying from a\Nserious illness. I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.85,0:02:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.29,0:02:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.20,0:02:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are not fit to be the\Ncaptain of this ship, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.49,0:02:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not everything can be fixed\Nby rushing to start a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.79,0:02:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't get into a fight here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.01,0:02:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.17,0:02:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would happen to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.87,0:02:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.33,0:02:55.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.57,0:02:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.97,0:02:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.55,0:03:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our friend needs you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.83,0:03:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you to our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.67,0:03:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.15,0:03:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, just ask politely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.79,0:03:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're incredible, Vivi!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.71,0:03:34.71,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,801)\fad(1000,0)\blur0.6\bord2.3\c&H121211&\3c&H121211&\1a&HFF&\t(955,1000,\1a&H00&)}Adventure in a\NNameless Country
Dialogue: 2,0:03:30.71,0:03:34.71,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,801)\fad(1000,0)\blur0.6\bord0\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&}Adventure in a\NNameless Country
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.97,0:03:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is one thing I feel I\Nshould warn you about, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.81,0:03:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only doctor we have\Nhere is actually a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.21,0:03:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.12,0:03:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.25,0:03:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.91,0:03:50.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything about this island is messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.03,0:03:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you people call\Nthis weird place anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.45,0:03:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, this land still\Ndoesn't have a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.91,0:03:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An island without a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.69,0:04:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that was possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.91,0:04:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bear! Hurry, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.71,0:04:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretend to be dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.17,0:04:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hiking bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.45,0:04:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He poses no threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.23,0:04:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.67,0:04:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's proper manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.87,0:04:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.78,0:04:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.41,0:04:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can finally get back\Nto some real training.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.05,0:04:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was getting sick of that modified training\Nthat I had to do with my stupid injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.63,0:04:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, just watching the\Nship is boring as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.97,0:04:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe some ice water swimming will\Nhelp me clear up my head a bit.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.87,0:04:52.79,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,663)\fad(479,0)\blur0.4\bord4.3\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp2\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\b0\t(434,479,\1a&H00&)}Bighorn\NTown of Snow
Dialogue: 2,0:04:46.87,0:04:52.79,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,663)\fad(479,0)\blur0.4\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp2\c&HE6E7E7&\4a&HFF&\b0}Bighorn\NTown of Snow
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.59,0:04:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the village where we live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.63,0:04:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its name is Bighorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.85,0:04:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at all the weird animals\Nwalking around everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is snow country.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.55,0:05:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Nami, we've made it\Nto a village with people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.53,0:05:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the help, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.97,0:05:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're not a guard, you\Ncan return to your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.69,0:05:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you completely certain that\Nyou'll be all right here by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.45,0:05:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.51,0:05:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe these people mean us no harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.71,0:05:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my hunch anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.29,0:05:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can trust me on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.89,0:05:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what should we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.33,0:05:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Dalton says they're all right,\Nthen I think we should believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.29,0:05:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They do seem to be pretty harmless, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.39,0:05:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.69,0:05:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.61,0:05:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll leave them to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.21,0:05:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, be careful, Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.37,0:05:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And call us again if you need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.05,0:05:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean those men weren't\Nyour land security forces?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.67,0:05:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.58,0:05:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just ordinary citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.13,0:05:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to my house for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.81,0:05:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.72,0:05:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look over there, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.75,0:05:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's one of those hiking bears!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.15,0:05:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.09,0:05:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.13,0:05:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard that some pirates\Nlanded on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.39,0:05:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope everything is all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.97,0:05:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.43,0:05:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.49,0:05:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just want you to know, Dalton, I'm looking\Nforward to the election in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.89,0:06:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone I've talked to has said\Nthey're going to vote for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.79,0:06:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're not serious about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.97,0:06:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just an ordinary citizen, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.67,0:06:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can use that bed over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.55,0:06:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to warm the place up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.79,0:06:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I should introduce myself.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:20.00,0:06:24.63,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,668)\fad(483,0)\blur0.4\bord4.5\fscx90\fscy90\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp4\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\b0\t(438,483,\1a&H00&)}Commander Dalton\NCivilian Garrison\NDrum Island
Dialogue: 2,0:06:20.00,0:06:24.63,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,668)\fad(483,0)\blur0.4\bord0\fscx90\fscy90\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp4\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&\b0}Commander Dalton\NCivilian Garrison\NDrum Island
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.83,0:06:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Dalton.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.74,0:06:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the captain of the\Nisland's security squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.81,0:06:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive our less\Nthan friendly welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.09,0:06:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but may I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.35,0:06:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.59,0:06:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that you look\Nfamiliar to me for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.31,0:06:38.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I just have one of\Nthose faces, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.59,0:06:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, can you tell us more about this\Ndoctor, or witch, if that's what she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.93,0:06:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami's fever's gone up to 107.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.91,0:06:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long has she had it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.69,0:06:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been several days, and\Nit just keeps getting higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.63,0:06:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll likely die if it gets any worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.53,0:06:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.44,0:06:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we have no idea what the illness\Nis, much less how to treat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.71,0:07:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know how to help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.17,0:07:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to find a doctor\Nas soon as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.79,0:07:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any doctor will do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.97,0:07:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is this witch of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.31,0:07:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.29,0:07:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see those mountains\Noutside the window?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.97,0:07:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I noticed them earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.07,0:07:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Supermassive Snowman!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.43,0:07:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the feared snowman Snowzilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.01,0:07:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.19,0:07:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get in here before I kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.27,0:07:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those mountains out there are\Nknown as the Drum Rockies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.89,0:07:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see the castle on top of the\Ntallest one, the one in the middle?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.19,0:07:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.23,0:07:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That castle has lost its key. Much warmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.23,0:07:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I see it up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.13,0:07:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's so important about the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.89,0:07:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That castle is where our land's\Nonly doctor lives, Dr. Kureha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.73,0:07:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the one who people\Nhere call a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.63,0:07:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.54,0:07:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of all places, why does she have\Nto live on top of a mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.85,0:07:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to call her here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.79,0:07:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami needs her help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.13,0:07:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I'm afraid\Nthere's no way to contact her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.13,0:07:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.87,0:07:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of a doctor is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.55,0:08:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her skills as a doctor are\Nquite impressive, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.51,0:08:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, she's an eccentric old woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.33,0:08:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's nearly 140 years old now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.57,0:08:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,140 no wonder she doesn't get\Naround much oh and one more
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.87,0:08:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thing she likes pickled plums\Nwhat happens when people here get
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.65,0:08:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sick or injured doesn't she help\Nthem she comes down from the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.01,0:08:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mountain whenever she feels like\Nit she looks around for patients
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.99,0:08:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she treats them then before she\Nleaves she takes whatever she
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.91,0:08:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wants from their houses as\Npayment she doesn't sound like a
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.05,0:08:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,very nice lady it kind of sounds\Nlike she's a pirate but how is
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.27,0:08:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a woman as old as she is capable\Nof getting down that mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.69,0:08:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's an odd rumor around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.23,0:08:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,several of the villagers\Nclaim they've seen her at
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.35,0:08:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,night riding a sleigh of\Nsome kind through the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.43,0:08:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they see her silhouette\Nwhen the moon is out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.51,0:08:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's the reason she is\Nthought to be a witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.15,0:08:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are others who say\Nthey've seen her with a
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.09,0:08:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,strange creature a creature\Nthat none of them recognize?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.75,0:09:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See I knew it a snow monster where there's\Nsnow there's gonna be snow monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.81,0:09:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I knew there'd be one
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.59,0:09:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to run into one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.25,0:09:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.16,0:09:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kureha is the only doctor we have,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.75,0:09:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but she's still a woman I\Nwould prefer to stay away from.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.77,0:09:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we can do is wait for the next time\Nshe decides to come down the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.79,0:09:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.05,0:09:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.17,0:09:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't wait here for that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.19,0:09:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami is getting even worse as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.33,0:09:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.47,0:09:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, wake up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.23,0:09:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.33,0:09:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.23,0:09:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, she's awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.55,0:09:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.46,0:09:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way to see the doctor\Nis to climb the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.73,0:09:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we're going to have\Nto climb the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.85,0:09:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.79,0:09:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you expect to get her up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.31,0:09:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy, she'll ride on my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.03,0:09:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's only going to\Nmake her even more sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.47,0:09:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.59,0:09:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we needed to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.19,0:09:52.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do, but you'll never make it up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.33,0:09:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at how steep and tall that thing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.41,0:09:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.43,0:09:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you can, but climbing that\Nthing would be way too hard on Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.83,0:10:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But look, even if we fall or\Nsomething, we'll land in snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.73,0:10:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.99,0:10:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A foal like that would\Nkill even a healthy person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.45,0:10:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, Luffy, she\Nhas a really bad fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.25,0:10:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so high she's almost dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.31,0:10:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.61,0:10:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to get over this\Nthing, and quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.25,0:10:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry for Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.09,0:10:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.51,0:10:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.91,0:10:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.65,0:10:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.31,0:10:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now our navigator's as\Ncrazy as our captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.99,0:10:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you're in no shape\Nfor a trip like this, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.79,0:10:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you'll be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.09,0:10:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll take you hours to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.63,0:10:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, old guy, give me\Nsome meat for the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.71,0:10:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.73,0:10:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, I'm coming too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.63,0:10:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Luffy, be very careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.81,0:11:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't fall even once\Nor Nami is going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.37,0:11:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.28,0:11:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even once!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.20,0:11:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold still a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.23,0:11:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to make sure that this is tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.87,0:11:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, you're all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.21,0:11:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to wait for you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.73,0:11:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I came with you guys,\NI'd only get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.29,0:11:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.45,0:11:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just hold on\Ntight to me, okay, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.83,0:11:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you're set on going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.99,0:11:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to try to stop you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.53,0:11:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I will ask you to at least\Nclimb up from the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.83,0:11:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way you can avoid the\Nloppins that are on this side
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.41,0:11:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're fierce carnivorous rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.69,0:11:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You run into a pack of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.19,0:11:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.17,0:11:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.35,0:11:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.26,0:11:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.67,0:11:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be just fine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.25,0:11:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.53,0:11:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious You know how\Neasily those things can kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.23,0:11:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, we'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.49,0:11:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now hurry it up Sanji before Nami dies!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.19,0:11:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say stuff like that you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.33,0:11:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to Jango us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.41,0:11:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure they'll be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.21,0:12:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not really those\Ntwo we need to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.83,0:12:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami's the one in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.25,0:12:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hope her strength\Ncan hold out long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.57,0:12:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's getting sicker by the minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.95,0:12:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you standing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.05,0:12:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.23,0:12:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.73,0:12:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, that's really okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.63,0:12:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to stay out here. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.53,0:12:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.77,0:12:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, I'll join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.69,0:13:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did once have some here on this island,\Nyou know, some doctors. However, all
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.73,0:13:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of them left some time ago for certain\Nreasons few months ago we suffered a
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.09,0:13:09.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vicious attack and our country was
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.13,0:13:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,destroyed destroyed by pirates oh man The
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.19,0:13:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whole country so that's the reason you\Nacted that way when we showed up yes
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.65,0:13:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After the attack the word pirate still\Nterrifies everyone on this island I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.15,0:13:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sorry about the way we treated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.69,0:13:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their group was small as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.95,0:13:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only five people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.45,0:13:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their captain called himself Blackbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.87,0:13:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their power was so\Nincredible they destroyed our
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.05,0:13:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,entire country faster\Nthan you would believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.07,0:13:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there were only five of them fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.99,0:13:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.95,0:13:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.86,0:13:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's more,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.78,0:13:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are some here who actually believed\Nthat it was good for the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.43,0:13:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could possibly be\Ngood about that happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.63,0:13:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.54,0:13:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would Say something like that anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.03,0:13:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.49,0:13:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.71,0:13:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they have their reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.79,0:14:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The king who ruled here before\Nthe attack was a horrible man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.25,0:14:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His rule was despised\Nby all of the citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.25,0:14:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our country used to be known as Drum\NKingdom and our king's name was Wobble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.89,0:14:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was the worst king imaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.43,0:14:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I remember him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.05,0:14:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that man. Not Wapol!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.45,0:14:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels like it's gotten a little colder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.71,0:14:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wind's picking up, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.23,0:14:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why don't you think about\Nputting on some real shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.79,0:14:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even seeing your feet\Nlike that is painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.71,0:14:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my police. Your police?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.69,0:14:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you mean policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.93,0:14:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.67,0:14:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So anyway, though, did you know this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.73,0:14:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People in snow countries\Nnever sleep at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.31,0:14:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.55,0:14:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if they do,\Nthey'll freeze to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.95,0:14:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.15,0:14:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone has to sleep sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.74,0:14:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone told me a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.65,0:15:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who, Usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.73,0:15:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I heard it in a pub in my village.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.55,0:15:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then explain this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.19,0:15:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that Dalton guy have a bed for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.17,0:15:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.21,0:15:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, maybe it's for when he dies!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.95,0:15:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.51,0:15:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.73,0:15:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.91,0:15:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Women in snowy countries have\Nskin that's as smooth as silk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.35,0:15:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.35,0:15:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.63,0:15:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, I'll explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.81,0:15:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you get cold, you rub\Nyour skin to warm it up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.53,0:15:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's always freezing cold in\Nsnowy countries like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.09,0:15:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the women keep rubbing\Ntheir skin all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.17,0:15:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and so it becomes all\Nwhite and silky smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.87,0:15:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but then how come it's white?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.93,0:15:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because the snow,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.83,0:15:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's constantly falling all over\Nthem, so it dyes their skin all white.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.07,0:15:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dee, you're really dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.39,0:15:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.41,0:15:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, give me a break like\Nyou're really one to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.69,0:15:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're becoming a pain in my ass! Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.15,0:15:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was with that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.01,0:16:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, just hang in there\Na little bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.63,0:16:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to get you\Nto a doctor, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.29,0:16:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snow's getting really deep around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.25,0:16:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, try to run\Nmore smoothly, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.01,0:16:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just making it harder on Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.77,0:16:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.45,0:16:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, they're big and they're\Nwhite, so they must be polar bears.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.99,0:16:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.81,0:16:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you know who Wapol is?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.79,0:16:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know who he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.83,0:16:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.15,0:16:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the pirate who attacked\Nour ship not too long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.25,0:16:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I was able to take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.15,0:16:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.09,0:16:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do remember him saying something\Nabout heading to Drum Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.17,0:16:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, there's no question about it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.05,0:16:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember it clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.35,0:16:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I met him once at a monarch\Nmeeting my father took me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.45,0:16:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was still very young then,\Nbut I remember it to this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.19,0:16:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A monarch meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.47,0:16:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.91,0:16:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.97,0:17:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the point is, we do know Wapol.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.57,0:17:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We ran into him yesterday,\Nwhen we were on our way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.83,0:17:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.74,0:17:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.57,0:17:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, I don't understand\Nwhat's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.37,0:17:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said he was a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.45,0:17:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't say anything about being a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.65,0:17:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just calling himself a\Npirate as some kind of disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.67,0:17:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In truth, Wapol is only\Nwandering the seas,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.05,0:17:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trying desperately to\Nreturn to this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.23,0:17:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.14,0:17:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapol and the people who were\Non his ship with him were kicked
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.59,0:17:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,off the island because they\Nwere no match for the pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.19,0:17:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.77,0:17:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not it. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.99,0:17:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it happened, when we were attacked,\NWaple's army didn't even try to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.01,0:17:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.33,0:17:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the second he learned how\Nstrong the pirates were,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.89,0:17:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapol grabbed his cronies\Nand ran like a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.21,0:17:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was the first one to abandon\Nthe country and flee out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.41,0:17:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, the country\Nfelt utter despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.55,0:17:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were left behind by our king.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.69,0:17:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What sort of king would\Ndo that to his country?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.89,0:17:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A king abandoning his people?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.91,0:18:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just the thought of that\Nmakes me absolutely sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.11,0:18:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.02,0:18:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.05,0:18:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one good thing that came out of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.77,0:18:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though, was the end of\NWaple's tyrannical rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.23,0:18:12.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people who were left on this\Nisland have come together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.91,0:18:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're trying to create a new country.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.71,0:18:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what we fear most right now is the\Nreturn of Wapol and his followers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.97,0:18:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The return of his brutal rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.27,0:18:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't afford for him to come\Nback now with a country so unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.53,0:18:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be the end of us we want to build
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.33,0:18:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ourselves a new peaceful\Nnation on this island
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.87,0:18:45.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, how can it move like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.99,0:18:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it a gorilla?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.93,0:18:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a polar bear! It's a rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.87,0:18:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you go from gorilla to rabbit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.99,0:18:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These must be the loppins that\NDalton was telling us about
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.63,0:18:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there sure are a lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.73,0:19:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapol, come quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.31,0:19:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.83,0:19:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you found that pirate's ship yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.19,0:19:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that isn't it, Wubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.21,0:19:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At long last, we've\Nreturned home. We have?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.19,0:19:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many long months have\Npassed wandering the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.53,0:19:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's our homeland. It's Drum Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.53,0:19:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It truly is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.87,0:19:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.53,0:19:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.71,0:19:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.95,0:19:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to make it to the castle\Nwhere the doctor lives and quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.47,0:19:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want you fighting\Nthese guys, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.23,0:19:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.17,0:19:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because Nami will be able\Nto feel every move you make.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.59,0:19:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's too sick to be able to\Nhandle something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.07,0:19:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.21,0:19:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She could die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.37,0:19:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.28,0:19:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.20,0:19:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, okay, then I\Nwon't fight them at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.35,0:19:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.15,0:20:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.69,0:20:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just dodge!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.03,0:20:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dodge, dodge and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.81,0:20:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.41,0:20:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a little difficult!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.23,0:20:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Launcher, shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.27,0:20:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dodging!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.35,0:20:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, in this snow I can't get my\Nfooting well enough to land a solid kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.19,0:20:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're attacking all at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.27,0:20:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Head for the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.35,0:20:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll cover you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.19,0:20:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go left!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.10,0:20:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll head to the mountains!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.05,0:20:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get rid of them somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.19,0:20:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would take us hours to fight them\Nall off, but how do we shake them now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.89,0:20:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For bunnies, these guys are tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.89,0:20:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.81,0:20:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.03,0:20:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.41,0:20:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you not to attack, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.47,0:20:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave them to me. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.73,0:21:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be screwing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.35,0:21:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, we can go up from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.57,0:21:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.71,0:21:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanna give me a lift?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.05,0:21:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you really have to taunt them? Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.09,0:21:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run for the top of the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.39,0:21:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The snow's really\Nstarting to pick up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.29,0:21:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, please just be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.29,0:21:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Dalton!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.25,0:21:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.77,0:21:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bow to the bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.79,0:21:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.03,0:21:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard the newcomers were looking for Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.47,0:21:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kureha.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.38,0:21:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but the sick woman's friends have\Nalready taken her up the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.13,0:21:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's too bad, because I heard\Nthe doctor's in Kokoro right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.95,0:21:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's where?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.53,0:21:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.44,0:21:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tsunami and the other's already past her?!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.06,0:21:52.81,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,670)\fad(477,0)\blur0.4\bord4.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp4\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\b0\fscx105\fscy105\t(432,477,\1a&H00&)}Cocoa Weed\NThe Next Town Over
Dialogue: 2,0:21:49.06,0:21:52.81,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,670)\fad(477,0)\blur0.4\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp4\c&HE5E5E5&\4a&HFF&\b0\fscx105\fscy105\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)}Cocoa Weed\NThe Next Town Over
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.81,0:21:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.03,0:22:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've had enough of this crying already.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.49,0:22:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just make him stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.13,0:22:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's driving me nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.87,0:22:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.05,0:22:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tamachibi, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.79,0:22:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hurt somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.07,0:22:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to stop crying\Nand tell me what's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.01,0:22:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're upsetting the customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.37,0:22:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tamachibi! Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.99,0:22:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't stop crying,\Nyou're going to go to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.77,0:22:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.89,0:22:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't find the witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.01,0:22:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.27,0:22:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's got that weird\Nmonster with her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.53,0:22:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.44,0:22:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of this. Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.67,0:22:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't sound like a very\Nnice father in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.25,0:22:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If a child is crying uncontrollably,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.57,0:22:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chances are something is wrong\Nand he doesn't know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.37,0:22:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay there for now, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.63,0:22:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.09,0:22:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's... you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.23,0:22:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So are you kids happy?
Dialogue: 2,0:22:59.17,0:23:02.71,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1021,741)\fad(478,0)\blur0.4\bord0\fscx76\fscy76\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp4\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&\b0}Tony Tony Chopper\NDr. Kureha's \NBeloved Reindeer
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.21,0:23:02.71,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(394,293)\fad(478,0)\blur0.4\fscx76\fscy76\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp4\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\b0\t(433,478,\1a&H00&)}Dr. Kureha\NMaster {of Doctors}Physician\N(Age 139)
Dialogue: 2,0:22:59.21,0:23:02.71,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(394,293)\fad(478,0)\blur0.4\bord0\fscx76\fscy76\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp4\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&\b0}Dr. Kureha\NMaster {of Doctors}Physician\N(Age 139)
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.21,0:23:02.71,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1021,741)\fad(478,0)\blur0.4\fscx76\fscy76\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp4\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\b0\t(433,478,\1a&H00&)}Tony Tony Chopper\NDr. Kureha's \NBeloved Reindeer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.71,0:23:04.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor! Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.21,0:23:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone want my secret to staying young?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.03,0:23:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we're fine, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.39,0:23:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe she's\Nreally 140 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.99,0:23:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have you know I'm only 139.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.13,0:23:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall I treat the boy?\NWait, what? He's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.55,0:23:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He isn't sick or hurt or anything, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.53,0:23:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.73,0:23:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.67,0:23:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, please come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.57,0:23:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.79,0:23:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.33,0:23:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was aware that the doctor had come into
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.23,0:23:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,town from the mountain\Nin the last few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.21,0:23:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I assumed that she'd left and\Nwouldn't be back for quite some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.47,0:23:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.67,0:23:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.97,0:23:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The problem here is how abnormally\Nstrong Lupi and Sanji are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.39,0:23:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we go up the mountain after them,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.29,0:23:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no way we'd be\Nable to catch up to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.65,0:23:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we are able to find the\Nwitch in this Kokoa-wee place,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.35,0:24:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we just need to tell her to get back up the\Nmountain as quickly as she possibly can.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.31,0:24:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right. That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.29,0:24:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.55,0:24:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive us. Huh? Forgive this\Nland for not having more doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.71,0:24:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say that this isn't something\Nthat you need to be apologizing for.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.81,0:24:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton, she's right about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.49,0:24:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.49,0:24:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.51,0:24:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They hurt. Your hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.67,0:24:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.37,0:24:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.97,0:24:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.05,0:24:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you've forgotten all\Nabout your hands hurting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.59,0:24:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.55,0:24:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.65,0:24:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you happy? You're happy. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.99,0:24:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now stay nice and quiet. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.81,0:24:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you should calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.37,0:24:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only touched his leg,\Nand I did it very lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.39,0:24:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard a terrible noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.47,0:25:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has pain in his hands and legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.93,0:25:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.73,0:25:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The swelling here on his leg is\Nfrom a purulent inflammation,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.33,0:25:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.19,0:25:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By now, the bone is surely infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.87,0:25:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, bring me some antibiotics.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.25,0:25:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.71,0:25:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.79,0:25:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The key to curing this disease is\Ntreating it before it can get too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.55,0:25:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, he'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.29,0:25:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, he did almost die. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.93,0:25:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost died?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.21,0:25:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna do a little operation, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.63,0:25:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, aren't you gonna use any anesthesia?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.35,0:25:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the anesthesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.39,0:25:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.59,0:25:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now see how easy that was?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.71,0:25:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it for the treatment, or\Nthe part you need me for anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.33,0:25:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.53,0:25:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just make sure he rests and\Nkeep his legs tightly bandaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.23,0:25:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once they're bandaged, keep them ice down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.83,0:25:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.99,0:25:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.90,0:25:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now about my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.11,0:25:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all out of trash\Nbags and toilet paper,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.53,0:25:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'm taking all of those that you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.81,0:26:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,along with all your food and plum wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.23,0:26:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In addition to that, I'll be taking\N50% of this restaurant's assets.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.39,0:26:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, take it all to the sled.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.35,0:26:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is outrageous!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.61,0:26:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't take half my assets!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.13,0:26:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't even think about\Ngiving her all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.29,0:26:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.20,0:26:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.65,0:26:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.56,0:26:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's way too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.67,0:26:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you take\Nadvantage of a sick person.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.93,0:26:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.89,0:26:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are a real doctor at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.01,0:26:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.47,0:26:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.93,0:26:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just a bunch of\Nblabbering children. Old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.17,0:26:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.27,0:26:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.81,0:26:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.49,0:26:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like your\Nson just gave me a nice tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.81,0:26:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'll reduce my fee to 49%.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.39,0:26:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pay your price. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.43,0:27:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Hey, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.49,0:27:02.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This happiness you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.67,0:27:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you ever forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.61,0:27:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.61,0:27:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's freezing out here my whole body is\Nbeginning to go numb i feel more like a
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.41,0:27:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,popsicle than a human at the moment looks
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.71,0:27:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like i have a lot more\Ntraining to do but if
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.81,0:27:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i really concentrate i shouldn't be bothered\Nby even the coldest temperatures hey
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.05,0:27:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karoo want to come in with me it's a great\Nway to get your little bird body in shape?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.67,0:27:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to see\Nthis many fish here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.59,0:27:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've got more to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.11,0:28:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.41,0:28:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it doesn't look like it. Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.49,0:28:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we lost them, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.15,0:28:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, we haven't yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.87,0:28:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.77,0:28:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are they jumping up and down?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.47,0:28:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're grouchy\Nbecause they're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.73,0:28:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.27,0:28:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.91,0:28:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.25,0:28:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.43,0:28:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've arrived at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.51,0:28:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all this time, I've\Nreturned to Drum Kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.71,0:28:52.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm finally home!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.13,0:28:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were they trying to pretend\Nto be a real military?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.75,0:29:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bunch of idiots and amateurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.03,0:29:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were they thinking\Nshooting at us like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.19,0:29:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my dear Drum Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.45,0:29:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your towering majesty has grown\Neven more beautiful in my absence!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.15,0:29:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chess, is the castle alright? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.03,0:29:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks just as good as when we left it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.53,0:29:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.51,0:29:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.51,0:29:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.01,0:29:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go home, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.49,0:29:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done being a pirate. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.71,0:29:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be king again!
Dialogue: 1,0:29:27.56,0:29:33.06,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,695)\fad(480,480)\blur0.4\bord4.5\fscx95\fscy95\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp4\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\b0\t(435,480,\1a&H00&)\t(5020,5065,\1a&HFF&)}Robson\NWhite Walky\N(Wooly Hippo)
Dialogue: 2,0:29:27.56,0:29:33.06,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,695)\fad(480,480)\blur0.4\bord0\fscx95\fscy95\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp4\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&\b0}Robson\NWhite Walky\N(Wooly Hippo)
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.41,0:29:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Onward, Robson!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.63,0:29:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robson, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.69,0:29:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you just standing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.97,0:29:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.88,0:29:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get moving already!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.43,0:29:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapol!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.34,0:29:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.93,0:29:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.37,0:29:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.13,0:29:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ones from the other day,\Ntheir ship's over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.79,0:29:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.70,0:29:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not them!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.62,0:29:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are the Straw Hat\Npirates doing in my country?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.83,0:29:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare they come here after\Npretending to not even know about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.53,0:30:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does he not even care?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.47,0:30:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a very painful recovery! You!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.33,0:30:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go kill those pirates now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.75,0:30:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I demand it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.77,0:30:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, actually, the ship\Nis empty, sir. Empty?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.15,0:30:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know where they went!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.11,0:30:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to be executed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.39,0:30:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our apologies, Wapol.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.91,0:30:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.91,0:30:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man is just a useless subordinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.89,0:30:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chess!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.07,0:30:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We took the liberty of inspecting the\Nfootprints that led away from the ship.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:26.57,0:30:31.20,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(986,722)\fad(480,480)\blur0.4\bord3.5\fscx71\fscy71\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp4\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\b0\t(435,480,\1a&H00&)\t(4150,4195,\1a&HFF&)}Chess\NStaff Officer of Evil\NFormer Kingdom of Drum
Dialogue: 2,0:30:26.57,0:30:31.20,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(986,722)\fad(480,480)\blur0.4\bord0\fscx71\fscy71\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp4\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&\b0}Chess\NStaff Officer of Evil\NFormer Kingdom of Drum
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.61,0:30:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we have some information.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.21,0:30:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:31.25,0:30:34.71,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(456,214)\fad(480,0)\blur0.4\bord3.5\fscx71\fscy71\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp4\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\b0\t(435,480,\1a&H00&)}Kuromarimo\NGreat Minister of Evil\NFormer Kingdom of Drum
Dialogue: 2,0:30:31.25,0:30:34.71,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(456,214)\fad(480,0)\blur0.4\bord0\fscx71\fscy71\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp4\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&\b0}Kuromarimo\NGreat Minister of Evil\NFormer Kingdom of Drum
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.12,0:30:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks as if the footprints\Nwere headed toward Bighorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.93,0:30:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.87,0:30:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was absolutely brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.09,0:30:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, we're headed on to Bighorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.53,0:30:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll stop there to fire a salute to\Nthe restoration of Throck Kingdom!
Dialogue: 1,0:30:51.39,0:30:55.10,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,0)\blur0.4\bord4.4\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp4\c&H000000&\b0\1a&HFF&\fscx110\fscy110\t(435,480,\1a&H00&)\pos(713.12,742)}Cocoa Weed
Dialogue: 1,0:30:51.39,0:30:55.10,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,0)\blur0.4\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp4\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&\b0\pos(713.12,742)\fscx110\fscy110}Cocoa Weed
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.57,0:30:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what are you telling us?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.87,0:30:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean the witch left this\Ntown just a few moments ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.95,0:30:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you've got to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.55,0:31:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.01,0:31:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She left after she made\Nmy sickness all better.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.25,0:31:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're looking for the\Ndoctor, she's already left.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.39,0:31:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.87,0:31:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you tell us where she was\Nheaded when she left here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.11,0:31:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.63,0:31:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard from somebody else\Nthat she was headed for Gyasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.31,0:31:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gyasta?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.22,0:31:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So where is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.14,0:31:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we were going to Geasta from Bighorn,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.15,0:31:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'd go in the opposite direction,\Nthen we went to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.39,0:31:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.30,0:31:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We already passed her?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.27,0:31:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice skating is very popular there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.13,0:31:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that have to do with anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.07,0:31:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.03,0:31:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.17,0:31:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get going to that town.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.07,0:31:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this point, we really\Ndon't have any time to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.95,0:31:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.29,0:31:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.20,0:31:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found you at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.25,0:31:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Carrot, but I thought\Nyou were standing watch today.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.03,0:31:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter I can tell that you've\Nbeen badly injured tell me what went wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.07,0:31:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every watchman except\Nfor me they've all been
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.35,0:31:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,killed Dalton watch this\Nthing this submarine
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.77,0:32:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sailboat it came out of\Nnowhere and it attacked
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.23,0:32:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us they killed every one of the watchmen
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.33,0:32:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we Couldn't stop them who are they I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.61,0:32:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,understand please explain\Nthis please Dalton you
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.61,0:32:12.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have to help Us we aren't strong enough to
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.73,0:32:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fight them you have to\Ndo something what's wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.53,0:32:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was them it was wobble\Nwobble and his men they came
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.75,0:32:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back, what did he say? What was back?\NThat can't be true. Why is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.63,0:32:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.87,0:32:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.45,0:32:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to settle this once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.71,0:32:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, I don't know if it\Ncan really be called justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.05,0:32:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may be just as guilty as you are, but\Nyou're the one who will be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.59,0:32:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.51,0:32:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you, Wapol!

